"队的标准化培训，快速响应并解决了用户问题，从而赢","box":[0.6876901250222919,0.8296374285662615,0.24897355455392484,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.6876901250222919,0.844461116084346],"font":"NotoSansCJKjp-Regular-VK","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Noto Sans CJK JP"},{"anchor":"text-49","text":"得了广泛好评，构筑了良好的品牌口碑","box":[0.6876901250222919,0.8563040839301215,0.1763793729907472,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.6876901250222919,0.871127771448206],"font":"NotoSansCJKjp-Regular-VK","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Noto Sans CJK JP"},{"anchor":"text-50","text":"通过实施新商家入驻免佣期、流量扶持等激励政策，","box":[0.06782433110737345,0.8029707732024016,0.238651784831578,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.06782433110737345,0.8177944607204861],"font":"NotoSansCJKjp-Regular-VK","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Noto Sans CJK JP"},{"anchor":"text-51","text":"我们成功吸引了众多优质品牌入驻，极大地丰富了商","box":[0.06782433110737345,0.8296374285662615,0.23863932360997775,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.06782433110737345,0.844461116084346],"font":"NotoSansCJKjp-Regular-VK","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Noto Sans CJK JP"},{"anchor":"text-52","text":"品供给，为平台的长期发展注入了新的活力","box":[0.1092801768984846,0.8563040839301215,0.19706474653652745,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.1092801768984846,0.871127771448206],"font":"NotoSansCJKjp-Regular-VK","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Noto Sans CJK JP"}],"reconstruction":"source-rendered independent vector layers + HTML text","baselineWarnings":["connector-routing-approximated","vector-shapes-require-export-review"],"composition":{"file":"compositions/e46aa4161157-0017.json","pageSha256":"b75d264521c32a3a450540eac2d7b8ae4620aa3273fbb2fa700b4465450f3381","revision":"b75d264521c32a3a","stats":{"sourceObjects":95,"sourceLeafObjects":85,"slots":37,"mappedSourceObjects":37,"unmappedSourceObjects":58,"htmlAnchors":103,"unmappedAnchors":9,"unknownBoxAnchors":6,"mappedAnchors":52,"ambiguousAnchors":42,"nativeAnchors":44,"fallbackAnchors":6,"unclassifiedPaintA